sc":"告诉用户现在选的是什么","desc_en":"Tells the user what's selected right now"},{"key":"caret","cn":"下拉箭头","en":"Caret","desc":"表示内容可以展开，图标可随展开状态变化","desc_en":"Signals that the control can expand and its appearance changes when open"},{"key":"panel","cn":"下拉面板","en":"Dropdown","desc":"显示所有选项的浮层，可以搜索和分组","desc_en":"The overlay that holds all options — it can be searchable and grouped"},{"key":"option","cn":"选项","en":"Option","desc":"悬停高亮，选中项带对勾","desc_en":"Highlights on hover; the selected one gets a checkmark"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"基础单选","en":"Default","demo":"<span class=\"custom-select\" data-custom-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-trigger\" data-custom-select-trigger\n      aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"custom-select-value\" data-custom-select-value>全部状态</span>\n      <i class=\"select-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </button>\n    <span class=\"custom-select-menu\" role=\"listbox\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option on\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"全部状态\">\n        <span>全部状态</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"进行中\">\n        <span>进行中</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button>\n    </span>\n  </span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"custom-select\" data-custom-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-trigger\" data-custom-select-trigger\n      aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"custom-select-value\" data-custom-select-value>All Status</span>\n      <i class=\"select-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </button>\n    <span class=\"custom-select-menu\" role=\"listbox\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option on\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"All Status\">\n        <span>All Status</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"In Progress\">\n        <span>In Progress</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button>\n    </span>\n  </span>","when":"选项固定、只选一个时的默认形态","when_en":"The default shape when options are fixed and only one gets picked"},{"cn":"多选","en":"Multiple","demo":"<div class=\"select-box\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">前端</span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">后端</span><i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"select-box\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Frontend</span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">Backend</span><i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","when":"选项偏多又要同时选好几个时用","when_en":"For picking several at once from a longer list"},{"cn":"可搜索","en":"Searchable","demo":"<div class=\"select-open\"><div class=\"select-box\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">🔍</span>深圳<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div><div class=\"select-panel\" style=\"min-width:140px\"><span class=\"select-opt on\">深圳</span><span class=\"select-opt\">上海</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"select-open\"><div class=\"select-box\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">🔍</span>Shenzhen<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div><div class=\"select-panel\" style=\"min-width:140px\"><span class=\"select-opt on\">Shenzhen</span><span class=\"select-opt\">Shanghai</span></div></div>","when":"选项较多时，可通过输入定位目标选项","when_en":"With dozens of options, typing finds the target fast"},{"cn":"可清空","en":"Clearable","demo":"<div class=\"select-box\">进行中<i class=\"select-clear\">✕</i><i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"select-box\">In Progress<i class=\"select-clear\">✕</i><i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","when":"筛选条件可选时，允许用户恢复为未选择状态","when_en":"When the filter is optional — one click back to nothing selected"},{"cn":"禁用","en":"Disabled","demo":"<div class=\"select-box dis\">全部状态<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"select-box dis\">All Status<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","when":"条件不满足时暂时禁用，防止误选","when_en":"Temporarily locked until conditions are met, preventing misclicks"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>值来自一组固定选项</b>：状态、分类、优先级","m":"sel-list"},{"t":"<b>选项较多、平铺不便</b>：收进下拉列表","m":"sel-many"},{"t":"<b>列表页的筛选条件</b>：几个选择器排一排，即选即筛","m":"sel-compact"},{"t":"<b>选项文案比较长</b>：模板、文件这类带描述的选项","m":"sel-long"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>选项较少且需要直接比较</b>：使用 {c:radio} 平铺展示","m":"sel-radio"},{"t":"需要<b>选择多个选项</b>：使用 {c:checkbox} 或多选选择器","m":"sel-checkbox"},{"t":"<b>选项有上下级</b>，如省市区、类目：使用 {c:cascader}","m":"sel-cascader"},{"t":"允许用户<b>输入新值</b>：使用 {c:auto-complete} 或支持创建的选择器","m":"sel-combobox"}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"用户需要从 4 个固定时区中选择一个。哪种选择方式最合适？","options":[{"id":"select","label":"放进下拉选择框，并显示当前选中的时区","feedback":"对。固定选项里只选一个时，选择器能节省空间并清楚表达当前值。","correct":true},{"id":"free-text","label":"使用带格式提示的输入框，让用户填写 UTC+8 之类的值","feedback":"自由文本容易产生无效或不一致的值。","correct":false},{"id":"four-buttons","label":"使用可搜索的下拉框，并允许创建列表外的新时区","feedback":"只有四个固定值时，不需要搜索和创建新值；额外能力会让用户误以为可以保存系统不支持的时区。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A form lets people choose one of four fixed, exclusive time zones. Which control fits?","options":[{"id":"select","label":"Use a Select and show the current time zone","feedback":"Correct. A selector saves space and clearly represents the current value for one option from a fixed set.","correct":true},{"id":"free-text","label":"Use unrestricted text so people type a time zone","feedback":"Free text easily creates invalid or inconsistent values.","correct":false},{"id":"four-buttons","label":"Make the four peer values submit buttons","feedback":"These are mutually exclusive values for one field, not four immediate actions.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把时区字段改成固定选项的 Select，保留当前值并为每个选项提供清楚名称。键盘选择一个新时区后保存，再刷新确认显示和已保存值一致。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Change the time-zone field to a Select with fixed options, retaining the current value and clear names. Choose a new value by keyboard, save, then refresh and confirm display and stored value match."}},"demoDetail":"<span class=\"custom-select open\" data-custom-select>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-trigger\" data-custom-select-trigger\n      aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\n      <span class=\"custom-select-value\" data-custom-select-value>全部状态</span>\n      <i class=\"select-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n    </button>\n    <span class=\"custom-select-menu\" role=\"listbox\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option on\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"全部状态\">\n        <span>全部状态</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"进行中\">\n        <span>进行中</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"已完成\">\n        <span>已完成</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button><button type=\"button\" class=\"custom-select-option\"\n        role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\"\n        data-custom-select-option data-value=\"已过期\">\n        <span>已过期</span><i class=\"custom-select-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</i>\n      </button>\n    </span>\n  </span>","references":[{"title":"<select>：HTML 选择元素","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/H